
  <sn><md>### Environmental Mutagens

Environmental mutagens are `agents in the environment` that can `induce mutations by damaging DNA` or disrupting genetic stability. They include chemicals, radiation, and certain biological agents, and may affect public health.

![img](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Nh-emon/QDoc/main/SES3/media/toxicology/classification_of_mutagens.png)
</md></sn>
